quote":"洪"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-050","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-050-he","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-050-he","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-050-he:line058","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-050-he:line058:m0206","quote":"洪"}],"identity_note":"依本篇具名、稱謂及其所在原句辨認；引書原字存於各自來源。"},{"id":"xms_rnf_fpk_A","label":"何邈","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","review":"ai_provisional","aliases":[{"surface":"邈","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-050-he:line058:m0210"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-050","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-050-he","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-050-he","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-050-he:line058","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-050-he:line058:m0210","quote":"邈"}],"identity_note":"依本篇具名、稱謂及其所在原句辨認；引書原字存於各自來源。","family_path":{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"xms_rnf_fpk","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-050","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-050-he","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-050-he","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-050-he:line058","quote":"孫和何姬，丹楊句容人也。父遂，本騎士。孫權嘗遊幸諸營，而姬觀於道中，權望見異之，命宦者召入，以賜子和。生男，權喜。名之曰彭祖，即皓也。太子和既廢，後為南陽王，居長沙。孫亮即位，孫峻輔政。峻素媚事全主，全主與和母有隙，遂勸峻徙和居新都，遣使賜死，嫡妃張氏亦自殺。何姬曰：「若皆從死，誰當養孤？」遂拊育皓及其三弟。皓即位，尊和為昭獻皇帝，何姬為昭獻皇后，稱昇平宮，月餘，進為皇太后。封弟洪永平侯，蔣溧陽侯，植宣城侯。洪卒，子邈嗣，為武陵監軍，為晉所殺。植官至大司徒。吳末昏亂，何氏驕僭，子弟橫放，百姓患之。故民訛言「皓久死，立者何氏子」云。","source_term":"洪卒，子邈嗣"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu050-he-8","interpretation_note":"本句所記父子；識別後綴不表示長幼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-sanguozhi-050-he","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-050","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-050-he","raw_mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-050-he:line058:m0191","c-sanguozhi-050-he:line058:m0206"],"paragraph_ids":["c-sanguozhi-050-he:line058"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-050-he:line058:m0191","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-050-he:line058:m0191"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id"